 "segments": [
  {
   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "Headline",
   "text": "The Momcozy Wellness 1",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdObCu5l/Headline"
  },
  {
   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "Primary Text",
   "text": "The Momcozy Wellness 1 | Momcozy® Official | Find Your Cozy Pump Style | Momcozy Massage Pump | Gentle & Protected | Be Cozy While Pumping | Find Your Perfect Pump | Wearable Pump Picks for Moms | Warm Massage Breast Pump | Find Ideal Pump for Your Needs | Heat & Massage in One Pump | Better Pumping Experience | Gentle & Effective Pumping | Smart Pumping for Moms | Best Pumps for Working Moms | Heat and massage help improve milk flow and comfort while pumping. | Improve pumping efficiency with warmth and gentle vibration. | Make every pumping session easier, smoother, and more effective. | Designed to help moms pump comfortably and efficiently every time.",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdObCu5l/Primary Text"
  },
  {
   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "修改建议",
   "text": "删除 more milk/增产催奶/催产素/长期奶量/裸奶阵排空承诺；合规替代为放松叙事+限定语，如 relaxation supports your natural let-down, which may help your flow（因为放松，自然奶阵可能更顺畅），只描述自然生理过程、不承诺产品带来结果；faster let-down/提高排空效率在拿到W1自身对照数据前禁用 ▸ 删除 safest/100% safe/zero risk/perfect 等虚假安全承诺，以及 fits all breast shapes/one size fits all/一定不损伤/适合所有胸型等绝对化适配承诺（best/#1/No.1 排名最高级已放开） ▸ 奶流/移除量/排空效率/漏奶/短时排乳类claim需W1自身对照数据（样本、对照、统计口径齐全），或改为放松叙事+限定语（may help/natural）；内部测试数值（28.2%/10%/70%）补齐前不得公开传播",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdObCu5l/修改建议"
  },
  {
   "kind": "field_value",
   "field_name": "命中原因",
   "text": "H02 催乳/增产/奶量产出承诺（含裸 more milk、催产素、长期奶量、裸奶阵/排空功效claim，无 FDA/临床证据）；放松叙事+限定语（natural let-down/may help）走 M07 语境守卫；H05 虚假安全承诺（best/#1/No.1/最佳/最好等排名最高级按2026-09-09口径放开，海外广告允许，不再判险）；M07 效率/漏奶/奶流/移除量/短时排乳类claim需W1自身对照数据（当前仅内部测试或外部研究，28.2%/10%/70%待补样本与统计），或限定为放松叙事；未补证据前需限定或删除",
   "anchor": "#广告文案明细/recvuJYdObCu5l/命中原因"
  },
  {
